  "independent_all_task_solutions": {
    "CQE1": "2x\u00b2+3x-5,x\u00b2+4x,x\u00b2-1;leading2,1,1. Simplifiedx\u00b2-x\u00b2+3=3constant. Geometricx>0 vs all-realalgebra distinct.",
